{"seq":3,"slug":"bbq-scalar-quant","title":"BBQ/标量量化与内存-精度取舍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/elasticsearch-vector-hybrid-search/vector-index/bbq-scalar-quant","wordCount":2788,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"bbq-标量量化与内存-精度取舍\">BBQ/标量量化与内存-精度取舍</h1><p>向量检索的内存瓶颈有一个容易算错的账：HNSW 图的连接开销常被忽略，而量化能砍掉的恰恰是向量本体那部分。一个 768 维、1000 万文档的索引，原始 float 向量占约 30.7 GB；这件事的严重性在于它通常意味着你不能只靠加内存解决，而要改变&quot;每条向量用多少字节表示&quot;这个前提。量化就是在做这个改变——把每个维度从 32 位浮点压缩到 8 位、4 位甚至 1 位，代价是相近的向量在压缩后可能无法区分，因此必须补一个重打分步骤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>量化（quantization）把&quot;每条向量占多少字节&quot;从 4 字节/维压到 1 字节、0.5 字节甚至 1 bit/维。它不是无损压缩，而是一次有意的近似：压缩后的向量空间与原空间之间存在形变，因此<strong>压缩后的距离排序与原距离排序不完全一致</strong>。整个机制成立的前提是 ES 把量化值与原始值分开存放——量化值进图索引用于快速筛选，原始 <code>float</code> 留在磁盘用于最终打分。</p>\n<p>这次近似的收益与代价可以写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Memory</mtext><mtext>quant</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>Memory</mtext><mtext>float</mtext></msub><mtext>compression ratio</mtext></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>Recall</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>loss</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>ratio</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>oversample</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Memory}_{\\text{quant}} = \\frac{\\text{Memory}_{\\text{float}}}{\\text{compression ratio}}, \\qquad \\Delta\\text{Recall} = \\text{loss}(\\text{ratio}, \\text{oversample})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0636em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Memory</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">quant</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">compression ratio</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Memory</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">float</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Recall</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">loss</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ratio</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">oversample</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中压缩比由量化类型决定（int8 为 4、int4 为 8、BBQ 为 32），召回损失由压缩比与超额取样倍数共同决定——后者是唯一可以在不重建索引的前提下补偿损失的旋钮。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量化家族</th>\n<th>每维比特</th>\n<th>压缩比</th>\n<th>搜索内存</th>\n<th>磁盘开销</th>\n<th>核心机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无量化（<code>hnsw</code>）</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>原始向量即索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>int8 标量量化</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>约 25%</td>\n<td>约 +25%</td>\n<td>按维线性映射到 256 级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>int4 标量量化</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>约 12.5%</td>\n<td>约 +12.5%</td>\n<td>按维线性映射到 16 级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BBQ 二值量化</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>约 3.1%</td>\n<td>约 +3.1%</td>\n<td>随机正交投影后取符号位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（内存降幅 75%/87%/96% 与磁盘开销 +25%/+12.5%/+3.1% 来源：Elasticsearch dense_vector 映射参考, <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/mapping-reference/dense-vector）\">https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/mapping-reference/dense-vector）</a></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[&quot;写入: float 向量&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;量化编码&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;图索引持有量化值&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; D[&quot;磁盘保留原始 float&quot;]&#10;  Q[&quot;查询向量&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;ANN 在量化空间筛选 k*oversample&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;用原始 float 重打分&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;截取 top-k&quot;]\">graph LR\n  A[\"写入: float 向量\"] --&gt; B[\"量化编码\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"图索引持有量化值\"]\n  A --&gt; D[\"磁盘保留原始 float\"]\n  Q[\"查询向量\"] --&gt; E[\"ANN 在量化空间筛选 k*oversample\"]\n  C --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[\"用原始 float 重打分\"]\n  D --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[\"截取 top-k\"]</pre><p>图中两个并行的存储路径（C 与 D）是理解全部量化取舍的钥匙：内存账在 C，磁盘账在 D，准确率补偿靠 F。</p>\n<h2 id=\"量化做了什么近似\">量化做了什么近似</h2><p>标量量化（scalar quantization）按维度独立操作。int8 的做法是为每一维（或每个段内每一维）找一个取值范围，把 float 线性映射到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>128</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>127</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-128, 127]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">128</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">127</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 这 256 个整数上：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>min</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mtext>max</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>min</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>255</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>128</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i = \\text{round}\\left(\\frac{x_i - \\text{min}_i}{\\text{max}_i - \\text{min}_i}\\times 255\\right) - 128</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3449em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">255</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>重建时做逆运算得到近似值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{x}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。误差的来源是这一步取整：每个维度的量化误差最大约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>max</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>min</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>255</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\text{max}_i - \\text{min}_i)/255</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/255</span></span></span></span></span>。int4 把映射目标缩到 16 个取值，误差放大约 16 倍。</p>\n<p>二值量化（BBQ，Better Binary Quantization）走的是另一条路，它不是&quot;更粗的标量量化&quot;，而是先用随机正交投影（random orthogonal projection）旋转向量空间，然后只保留每一维的符号位：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_i = \\begin{cases} 1 &amp; \\text{if } (\\mathbf{R}\\mathbf{x})_i \\ge 0 \\\\ 0 &amp; \\text{otherwise}\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Rx</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">otherwise</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>旋转的目的是让信息尽量均匀地分散到各维度上，避免某些维度承载绝大部分能量而在取符号时被抹掉。BBQ 把每维压到 1 位，因此内存降到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/32</span></span></span></span></span>——768 维的 1000 万条向量从 30.7 GB 降到不足 1 GB。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  X[原始 float 向量] --&gt; Q{量化方式}&#10;  Q --&gt;|&quot;int8: 按维线性映射到 256 级&quot;| I8[&quot;每维 1 字节, 省 75%&quot;]&#10;  Q --&gt;|&quot;int4: 按维线性映射到 16 级&quot;| I4[&quot;每维 0.5 字节, 省 87%&quot;]&#10;  Q --&gt;|&quot;bbq: 旋转变换后取符号位&quot;| BQ[&quot;每维 1 bit, 省 96%&quot;]&#10;  I8 --&gt; C[ANN 候选筛选]&#10;  I4 --&gt; C&#10;  BQ --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; R[&quot;用磁盘上的原始 float 重打分&quot;]&#10;  R --&gt; F[最终结果]\">graph TD\n  X[原始 float 向量] --&gt; Q{量化方式}\n  Q --&gt;|\"int8: 按维线性映射到 256 级\"| I8[\"每维 1 字节, 省 75%\"]\n  Q --&gt;|\"int4: 按维线性映射到 16 级\"| I4[\"每维 0.5 字节, 省 87%\"]\n  Q --&gt;|\"bbq: 旋转变换后取符号位\"| BQ[\"每维 1 bit, 省 96%\"]\n  I8 --&gt; C[ANN 候选筛选]\n  I4 --&gt; C\n  BQ --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; R[\"用磁盘上的原始 float 重打分\"]\n  R --&gt; F[最终结果]</pre><p>图里的最后一跳是量化能被接受的全部原因：原始 float 向量仍然保留在磁盘上，量化只在候选阶段起作用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"各量化类型的内存与磁盘账\">各量化类型的内存与磁盘账</h2><p>把 ES 官方给出的比例整理成一张可用来做容量估算的表（<code>float</code> 为基准）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>index_options.type</th>\n<th>搜索内存降幅</th>\n<th>搜索内存占比</th>\n<th>磁盘额外开销</th>\n<th>维度约束</th>\n<th>适用 element_type</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>hnsw</code></td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>≤4096</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>int8_hnsw</code></td>\n<td>约 75%</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>约 25%</td>\n<td>≤4096</td>\n<td><code>float</code>/<code>bfloat16</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>int4_hnsw</code></td>\n<td>约 87%</td>\n<td>12.5%</td>\n<td>约 12.5%</td>\n<td>偶数</td>\n<td><code>float</code>/<code>bfloat16</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bbq_hnsw</code></td>\n<td>约 96%</td>\n<td>3.1%</td>\n<td>约 3.1%</td>\n<td>&gt;64</td>\n<td><code>float</code>/<code>bfloat16</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>int8_flat</code> / <code>int4_flat</code> / <code>bbq_flat</code></td>\n<td>同上（无图开销）</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td><code>float</code>/<code>bfloat16</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bbq_disk</code></td>\n<td>面向磁盘，非纯内存</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>&gt;64，9.2 GA</td>\n<td><code>float</code>/<code>bfloat16</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意&quot;搜索内存&quot;与&quot;磁盘开销&quot;是两笔独立的账：量化索引会把原始向量留盘，因此磁盘用量不减反增（int8 增约 25%），换来的收益全在搜索期的堆内存上。如果你的瓶颈是磁盘而不是内存，量化不是答案；如果瓶颈是 JVM 堆或 page cache 命中率，量化通常是最直接的杠杆。</p>\n<p><code>bbq_disk</code> 是另一个设计取向：它用 IVF 风格的聚类（<code>cluster_size</code> 默认 384，范围 64–65536）加二值量化，把索引结构放在磁盘上按需读取，因此适合被内存容量卡住、但能接受延迟上升的超大规模场景。它需要 Enterprise 订阅，9.2 GA，且 9.4 起支持 <code>bits</code> 参数（1、2、4、7 位，可在不 reindex 的情况下调整）与 <code>precondition</code>（随机正交投影，创建后不可变）。（来源：Elasticsearch dense_vector 映射参考, <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/mapping-reference/dense-vector）\">https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/mapping-reference/dense-vector）</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"重打分与-oversample-的补偿机制\">重打分与 oversample 的补偿机制</h2><p>量化引入的误差会让&quot;排序错位&quot;而不是&quot;找不到&quot;：真正相关的文档可能落在候选池里但排在后面。补偿方法是超额取样再重打分——从量化索引取出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>×</mo><mtext>oversample</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\times \\text{oversample}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">oversample</span></span></span></span></span></span> 条候选，用磁盘上的原始 float 向量重新算分，最后截取前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 条。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"POST /documents/_search&#10;{&#10;  &quot;knn&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;field&quot;: &quot;vec&quot;,&#10;    &quot;query_vector&quot;: [0.1, 0.2, 0.3],&#10;    &quot;k&quot;: 10,&#10;    &quot;num_candidates&quot;: 100,&#10;    &quot;rescore_vector&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;oversample&quot;: 3.0&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">POST /documents/_search</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"knn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"vec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"query_vector\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"k\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"num_candidates\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rescore_vector\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"oversample\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>oversample</code> 的取值规则很明确：必须大于 1.0 且小于 10.0，或恰好为 0（表示关闭重打分）。它同时会抬高候选数——文档说明候选数至少被抬到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>num_candidates</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>×</mo><mtext>oversample</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(\\text{num\\_candidates}, k \\times \\text{oversample})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">num_candidates</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">oversample</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。查询里给出的 <code>rescore_vector</code> 会覆盖 mapping 里的同名设置，因此可以按查询类型区别对待：探索型查询用高 oversample，精确匹配型查询关掉它。（来源：Elasticsearch kNN 查询参考, <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/query-dsl-knn-query.html）\">https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/query-dsl-knn-query.html）</a></p>\n<p>各种量化在不开显式重打分时的默认 oversample 并不统一：int8/int4/bbq_hnsw 的映射级默认是 3.0 倍量级的做法，而 <code>bbq_disk</code> 按 <code>bits</code> 分流——1 位默认 3.0 倍、2 位默认 1.5 倍、4 位与 7 位默认不做超额取样。<code>bbq_disk</code> 的 9.5 新增 <code>auto_calibrate</code> 会在每个段上自动选择编码、oversample 与预处理，此时段自身的标定值优先，mapping 值退化为兜底；合并后不足 10000 条向量的段不做标定，默认 3.0 倍。（来源：Elasticsearch dense_vector 映射参考, <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/mapping-reference/dense-vector）\">https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/mapping-reference/dense-vector）</a></p>\n<p>成本要算清楚：oversample 从 1 倍提到 3 倍意味着重打分的向量数变成三倍，而重打分要读磁盘上的原始 float，因此延迟上升主要来自 IO 而不是 CPU。这也解释了为什么量化索引的延迟曲线在高 oversample 下会比纯 <code>hnsw</code> 更陡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选择判据与实测流程\">选择判据与实测流程</h2><p>把决策压缩成问题序列：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>内存是否真的不够？先用 <code>_nodes/stats</code> 确认向量段占用的绝对值，再算如果换成量化能省多少。如果集群有充足余量，不要为了省内存引入精度损失。</li>\n<li>维数是多少？低于 384 的向量在 9.1+ 默认仍走 <code>int8_hnsw</code>，此时直接沿用默认并把 <code>ef_construction</code> 提上去往往比强行上 BBQ 更稳。</li>\n<li>能接受多大的召回损失？int8 的损失通常在 1% 以内，int4 在 2%–5%，BBQ 在 3%–8%，具体数值必须实测——这些数字随数据集分布变化很大，不能当成定论。</li>\n<li>是否需要保留原始精度用于未来更换量化方式？需要的话就保留默认行为（原始 float 留盘），不要试图用 <code>byte</code>/<code>bit</code> 元素类型去&quot;顺便&quot;省磁盘。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>实测流程固定为四步：用同一份判断列表，分别测 <code>hnsw</code>（基线）、<code>int8_hnsw</code>、<code>bbq_hnsw</code> 的三组召回率与 P99 延迟；再在量化组上扫描 <code>oversample</code>（1.5、2、3、5）找回复召的拐点；记录每组的段内存；最后按&quot;召回损失可接受前提下占用最低&quot;选型。判断列表的构造方法与指标口径见 <a href=\"../integration-eval/recall-latency-eval\">召回率-延迟评估与 A/B</a>。</p>\n<p>一个容易踩的坑是把量化的召回损失和&quot;过滤条件导致的召回损失&quot;混在一起归因。如果查询带有很窄的过滤条件，返回条数不足 <code>k</code> 的根因通常在过滤器与 ANN 的交互，而不是量化误差——把 <code>oversample</code> 从这个实验里去掉、换成不带过滤的纯向量查询，就能把两个因素分离。过滤场景的完整讨论在 <a href=\"../rerank-filter/filtered-ann\">过滤 ANN：先过滤 vs 后过滤</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"迁移与不可逆的部分\">迁移与不可逆的部分</h2><p>量化设置的变更成本不对称，有几项是不可逆或需要重建的：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变更</th>\n<th>是否需要 reindex</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>int8_hnsw</code> → <code>bbq_hnsw</code></td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>索引结构不同，<code>m</code> 只能保持或增大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调整 <code>rescore_vector.oversample</code>（查询级）</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>每次请求都可指定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bbq_disk.bits</code>（1/2/4/7）</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>文档明确说明可在不 reindex 的情况下调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bbq_disk.precondition</code></td>\n<td>不可变</td>\n<td>创建后不可修改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bbq_disk.auto_calibrate</code></td>\n<td>不可变</td>\n<td>创建后不可修改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>element_type</code> 变更</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>且需要重新编码全部向量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行值得强调：从 <code>float</code> 换成 <code>byte</code> 不是&quot;压缩&quot;，而是&quot;换一种数据表示&quot;，你必须自己保证写入的向量已经是量化后的整数。如果你的向量由客户端生成，那么选定 <code>byte</code> 意味着量化逻辑搬到了客户端，模型升级时两边都要同步改；相比之下把 <code>float</code> 写进来、用 <code>index_options</code> 在 ES 内部量化，模型与压缩策略解耦，升级更安全。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"PUT /documents/_mapping&#10;{&#10;  &quot;properties&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;vec&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;dense_vector&quot;,&#10;      &quot;dims&quot;: 768,&#10;      &quot;element_type&quot;: &quot;float&quot;,&#10;      &quot;index_options&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;bbq_disk&quot;,&#10;        &quot;cluster_size&quot;: 384,&#10;        &quot;default_visit_percentage&quot;: 0,&#10;        &quot;bits&quot;: 2,&#10;        &quot;auto_calibrate&quot;: true&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PUT /documents/_mapping</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"properties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"vec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dense_vector\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dims\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">768</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"element_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"float\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"index_options\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bbq_disk\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"cluster_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">384</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"default_visit_percentage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"bits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"auto_calibrate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>上面这段是 <code>bbq_disk</code> 的完整可写形式（<code>auto_calibrate</code> 与 <code>precondition</code> 在创建时定下）。如果只是想在内存上省一档而不引入磁盘搜索的复杂度，把 <code>type</code> 换成 <code>bbq_hnsw</code> 并保持 <code>m</code> 与 <code>ef_construction</code> 即可——图结构不变，只是节点存储的向量被压成 1 位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>量化改变的是&quot;候选如何被快速筛出&quot;，最终打分仍回到磁盘上的原始 float，这是量化可用的前提。</li>\n<li>int8 省约 75% 搜索内存、int4 约 87%、BBQ 约 96%；磁盘开销则分别增加约 25%、12.5%、3.1%，两笔账要分开算。</li>\n<li><code>oversample</code> 是量化准确率的补偿旋钮，取值必须落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>10.0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1.0, 10.0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10.0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 或恰好为 0；查询级设置覆盖 mapping 级。</li>\n<li>ES 9.0 默认 <code>int8_hnsw</code>、9.1+ 按维数分流（≥384 用 <code>bbq_hnsw</code>）、9.4+ 可能默认 <code>bbq_disk</code>——不显式声明索引类型，实验结果不可复现。</li>\n<li><code>bbq_disk</code> 的 <code>bits</code> 可在线调整，但 <code>precondition</code> 与 <code>auto_calibrate</code> 创建后不可变。</li>\n<li>量化损失与过滤损失必须在实验里分离测量，否则会把过滤器的问题归因到量化上。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>量化索引建立之后，下一步是把向量检索与文本检索并行发出去——两路结果的分数不可比，怎么合起来是第二章的第一个问题，见 <a href=\"../hybrid-fusion/knn-bm25-combine\">KNN 与 BM25 并行召回</a>；如果内存仍然不够、<code>index_options</code> 已经没有可压的空间，那就不再是检索参数问题，而是集群容量与分片布局问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"BBQ/标量量化与内存-精度取舍","id":"bbq-标量量化与内存-精度取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"量化做了什么近似","id":"量化做了什么近似"},{"level":2,"text":"各量化类型的内存与磁盘账","id":"各量化类型的内存与磁盘账"},{"level":2,"text":"重打分与 oversample 的补偿机制","id":"重打分与-oversample-的补偿机制"},{"level":2,"text":"选择判据与实测流程","id":"选择判据与实测流程"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移与不可逆的部分","id":"迁移与不可逆的部分"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"HNSW 参数（m/ef_construction）与召回","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/elasticsearch-vector-hybrid-search/vector-index/hnsw-params"},"next":{"title":"KNN 与 BM25 并行召回","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/elasticsearch-vector-hybrid-search/hybrid-fusion/knn-bm25-combine"}}